# Frontend (`apps/web`)

- App Router. Server Components by default. `'use client'` only for quizzes, flashcards, uploads, theme toggle, and other interactive widgets.
- Routes: `(auth)` login/register; `(dashboard)` documents, exams, flashcards, team.
- Tenant-aware: personal dashboard and org workspaces share layouts; scope API calls with the active organization.
- Poll async jobs (document processing) with TanStack Query; do not busy-wait on the server.
- Types in `apps/web/types` stay aligned with Pydantic schemas. API client in `lib/api`.
- Proxy browser calls through Next rewrites to FastAPI; do not hardcode localhost in components.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
'use client'
export default async function Page() { /* RSC + client mixed */ }

// ✅ GOOD — server page, client island
export default function DocumentsPage() {
  return <DocumentUploader /> // DocumentUploader.tsx has 'use client'
}
```
